KubeVirt CI
===========

Local workflow
--------------

Docker Compatibility (required by gocli)
├─sudo mkdir -m 0700 -p /run/podman
├─sudo podman system service --time='0' unix:///run/podman/podman.sock &
├─disown "$(pgrep -f 'podman system service' --oldest)"
└─sudo ln -sf /run/podman/podman.sock /var/run/docker.sock

sudo ./cluster-provision/k8s/provision.sh
├─./cluster-provision/gocli/Makefile => build gocli + gocli container image
│ │ ├─CGO_ENABLED='0' go build -o build/ ./cmd/cli/
│ │ └─podman image build build/ --tag='quay.io/dollierp/gocli:20260720.0'
│ └─sudo podman image tag 'quay.io/dollierp/gocli:latest' 'quay.io/dollierp/gocli:20260720.0'
│
├─./cluster-provision/centos9/build.sh => build base CentOS VM image in a container
│ │ └─podman image build . \
│ │     --build-arg=BUILDARCH='x86_64' \
│ │     --build-arg=CENTOS_VERSION='20260720.0' \
│ │     --tag='quay.io/dollierp/centos9:latest'
│ └─sudo podman image tag 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:latest' 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:20260720.0'
│
├─sudo ../../gocli/build/cli provision ./cluster-provision/k8s/1.36 --phases linux,k8s
│ ├─starts a VM and customize the OS (phase linux)
│ │ └─docker container run 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:latest' /vm.sh ...
│ │   └─qemu
│ │     └─ssh sudo /bin/bash <./cluster-provision/k8s/1.36/provision.sh
│ ├─starts a VM and deploy k8s (phase k8s)
│ │ └─docker container run 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:latest' /vm.sh ...
│ │   └─qemu
│ │     └─ssh sudo /bin/bash <./cluster-provision/k8s/1.36/k8s_provision.sh
│ │       └─kubeadm
│ │         └─kubelet
│ │           ├─kube-apiserver
│ │           ├─kube-controller-manager
│ │           └─kube-scheduler
│ └─sudo podman image tag 'quay.io/dollierp/k8s-1.36:latest' 'quay.io/dollierp/k8s-1.36:20260413.0'
│
├─make cluster-up KUBEVIRTCI_TAG='20260413.0'
├─./cluster-up/check.sh => check for nested virtualization configuration
└─./cluster-up/up.sh
  ├─./cluster-up/hack/common.sh
  └─./cluster-up/cluster/k8s-1.36/provider.sh
    ├─./cluster-up/cluster/k8s-provider-common.sh
    │  └─./cluster-up/cluster/ephemeral-provider-common.sh => podman
    └─up
      └─podman quay.io/kubevirtci/gocli:${KUBEVIRTCI_TAG} run
        └─./cluster-provision/gocli run
          └─docker container run --privileged --name=k8s-1.36-node01 quay.io/kubevirtci/k8s-1.36:${KUBEVIRTCI_TAG} /vm.sh
            └─./cluster-provision/centos9/scripts/vm.sh => starts one container per node with /vm.sh as entrypoint
              └─qemu disk.qcow2

Debug workflow
--------------

sudo podman exec -it k8s-1.36-node01 /bin/bash
└─screen /dev/pts/0

sudo KUBEVIRTCI_TAG=latest ./cluster-up/ssh.sh node01

Prow workflow
-------------

### periodic-kubevirtci-bump-centos-base ###

PHASES=linux BYPASS_PMAN_CHANGE_CHECK=true ./publish.sh
├─./cluster-provision/centos9/build.sh
│ │ └─podman image build . \
│ │     --build-arg=BUILDARCH='x86_64' \
│ │     --build-arg=CENTOS_VERSION='20260720.0' \
│ │     --tag='quay.io/dollierp/centos9:latest'
│ └─podman image tag 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:latest' 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:20260720.0'
│
├─./cluster-provision/k8s/1.36/../provision.sh
│ ├─make -C ../gocli cli
│ │ └─sudo podman image tag 'quay.io/dollierp/gocli:latest' 'quay.io/dollierp/gocli:20260720.0'
│ │
│ └─sudo ../../gocli/build/cli provision ./cluster-provision/k8s/1.36 --phases linux
│   ├─sudo podman image pull 'quay.io/kubevirtci/centos9:2604210400-b17217c6'
│   ├─sudo podman image tag 'quay.io/kubevirtci/centos9:2604210400-b17217c6' 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:latest' # override the base CentOS image
│   └─starts a VM and customize the OS (phase linux)
│     └─docker container run 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:latest' /vm.sh ...
│       └─qemu
│         └─ssh sudo /bin/bash <./cluster-provision/k8s/1.36/provision.sh
├─sudo podman image tag 'quay.io/dollierp/centos-base:latest' 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9-base:20260720.0' 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:20260720.0'
├─sudo podman image push 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:20260720.0'
└─echo 'quay.io/dollierp/centos9:20260720.0' >cluster-provision/k8s/base-image

### check-provision-k8s-1.36 ###

PHASES=k8s ./cluster-provision/k8s/1.36/../provision.sh

### publish-kubevirtci ###

PHASES=k8s ./publish.sh

