### https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/QEMU#Audio ###

cluster-provision/gocli/cmd/run.go#provisionNode()
└─soundcardPCIIDs
  └─cluster-provision/gocli/opts/bind-vfio/bind-vfio.go#NewBindVfioOpt()
    └─cluster-provision/gocli/opts/bind-vfio/bind-vfio.go#Exec()

Binding a device to the `vfio-pci` driver is required for PCI-passthrough:
- https://docs.kernel.org/driver-api/vfio.html
- https://kernel-internals.org/virtualization/vfio/
- https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/PCI_passthrough_via_OVMF
- https://doc.ubuntu-fr.org/vfio
- https://community.ibm.com/community/user/blogs/tasmiya-nalatwad/2025/11/11/vfio-passthrough-in-kvm-guests

